# Elixir / Erlang
**/_build/
**/deps/
**/*.beam
**/erl_crash.dump
**/tmp/

# Rust
**/target/

# JS build
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.svelte-kit/
**/.wrangler/

# Wasm build cache + toolchain (regenerated; keep build/oql.wasm + build/commands)
runtime/build/cache/
runtime/build/tools/
# Content-addressed command artifacts are regenerated build outputs (sha256 names);
# curated commands (jq/grep) keep their plain names and stay tracked.
runtime/build/commands/*.wasm
!runtime/build/commands/jq.wasm
!runtime/build/commands/grep.wasm

# Secrets / local
.env
.env.local
**/workbook.local.json
*.pem

# OS
**/.DS_Store
.claude/
scratch/

# Beads / Dolt files (added by bd init)
.dolt/
*.db
.beads-credential-key
.beads/
